│                          │ adjacent LCP sum. It uses safe normalized string representations only for scoring,        │
│                          │ preserves original values in object dtype output, supports mixed types and missing        │
│                          │ values, and applies lightweight merge/dependency ordering constraints without modifying   │
│                          │ stored cell values.                                                                       │
